    <string name="preface_title">Thirukkural - The Universal Veda</string>
    <string name="preface_content">Thirukkural is one of the most important works in the Tamil language. It is a collection of 1,330 couplets (kurals) on virtue (Aram), wealth (Porul), and love (Inbam). Written by the legendary poet-philosopher Thiruvalluvar, these verses provide timeless guidance on ethical living.\n\n"Thinam Oru Kural" aims to bring this ancient wisdom into your daily life, one kural at a time.</string>
