    <string name="about_text">Thirukkural is a classic Tamil text consisting of 1,330 couplets (kurals) on virtue, wealth and love, authored by the poet-philosopher Thiruvalluvar.\n\nThis app delivers one Kural per day in sequential order, with Tamil explanation and English translation — completing all 1,330 kurals in about 3.6 years before cycling again.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_content">This app does not collect, store, or share any personal information. It operates entirely offline and requires no internet access for its core functionality. We value your privacy and do not use any third-party analytics or tracking tools.</string>
